---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party assets
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the code and everything generated by it. The
bundled third-party assets are separately dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0, and remain so however this repository is used. CC0 requires no
attribution; it is given anyway, and the full list is in CREDITS.md.

  Furniture models   Kenney — Furniture Kit                        CC0 1.0
                     Assets/ThirdParty/Kenney/FurnitureKit/
                     (original License.txt kept intact)

  Ambience           Freesound — seven recordings by TRP, Helmer88,
                     KaleidacousticsAudio, Breviceps, tec_studio
                     and qubodup                                   CC0 1.0
                     Assets/ThirdParty/FreesoundCC0/
                     (per-file sources in SOURCES.md)

MooseRunner, the test runner this project showcases, is a separate commercial
product and is NOT redistributed here. It is resolved as a Unity package from
the public npm registry, and its CLI lives in a gitignored folder.

The setting is inspired by "Discount Dan: A LitRPG Adventure" by James A.
Hunter. This is an unofficial fan demo, not affiliated with or endorsed by the
author, and no text or content from the books is reproduced in it.
